OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CToday:FRain clearing from Orkney by    
OL,6,Flate morning, then mainly dry and      
OL,7,Fbrighter this afternoon. A cloudy day  
OL,8,Facross Shetland with rain,             
OL,9,Foccasionally heavy, clearing around    
OL,10,Fmid-afternoon. Strong to gale          
OL,11,Fsoutheasterly winds easing by          
OL,12,Fafternoon.                             
OL,14,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry,     
OL,15,Fperhaps the odd shower across Shetland 
OL,16,Fat first. Then the rest of the night   
OL,17,Fwill be largely dry, a few showers     
OL,18,Fpossible across Shetland later.        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
