OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cloudy and increasingly    
OL,6,Fwindy day with a few showers across    
OL,7,FShetland, Orkney will be mostly dry.   
OL,8,FStrong to gale south or southeasterly  
OL,9,Fwinds by afternoon.                    
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny   
OL,12,Fintervals and a few passing showers on 
OL,13,FSunday and Tuesday. Windy with rain at 
OL,14,Ftimes on Monday, southwesterly gales.  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
